---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How It Works"
  description="How selling your car or requesting a used part with WRECKON works."
>
  <Container class="py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink-900">How It Works</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-ink-600">
      Whether you're selling a vehicle or looking for a specific part, the process starts the same
      way — tell us the details through the form, and we'll follow up directly by phone or email.
      Attaching a few photos where there's an option to isn't required, but it helps us respond with
      more accurate information the first time.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink-900">Selling Your Car</h2>
        <ol class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm text-ink-700">
          <li>
            <strong>1. Tell us about your vehicle</strong> — make, model, year and condition.
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">
              Including whether it's drivable and a few photos helps us put together a more accurate quote.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>2. We get back to you</strong> with a quote.
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">By phone or email, based on the details you've provided.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>3. If you accept</strong>, we arrange pick-up and payment by bank transfer or EFT.
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">
              Payment by bank transfer or EFT is in line with current Australian regulations restricting
              cash payments for vehicle purchases.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <Button href="/sell-your-car" class="mt-6">Get a Quote</Button>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink-900">Requesting a Part</h2>
        <ol class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm text-ink-700">
          <li>
            <strong>1. Tell us what you need</strong> — the vehicle and part details.
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">
              The more specific you can be (make, model, year, and which part), the faster we can check it.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>2. We check availability</strong> against what we've got.
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">
              The site doesn't show live stock yet, so this check happens after you submit a request.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>3. We get back to you</strong> with pricing and next steps.
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Including pick-up or delivery options where relevant.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <Button href="/parts/request" class="mt-6">Request a Part</Button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 max-w-2xl text-sm text-ink-500">
      Have a different question? Check the <a href="/faq" class="font-semibold text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">FAQ</a>
      or <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500">get in touch</a> directly.
    </p>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
